<title>BELGIUM: NEDEE RATES LERNOUT &amp; HAUSPIE BUY.</title>
<headline>NEDEE RATES LERNOUT &amp; HAUSPIE BUY.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of research report -</p>
<p>Co name-----------Sector------Price------Broker-------------</p>
<p>Lernout &amp; Hauspie Technology  $23.375*   Nedee &amp; Co</p>
<p>COMMENT: Lernout &amp; Hauspie Speech Products is in transition</p>
<p>from high risk situation to one of strong recurring revenues. On</p>
<p>basis of expected 1997 and 1998 EPS as well as revenue growth</p>
<p>potential of 40 percent in 1999 and 2000 we think a year from</p>
<p>now a 1998 price/earnings ratio of 25/30 would be justified.</p>
<p>This would give stock potential to trade between $40 and $50.</p>
<p>Recommendation: BUY (*) Date of research report: 12/06/97</p>
<p>Analysts: Kurt Janssens/Michel Vanderlinden</p>
<p> Estimates:   EPS	  pvs est   P/E     Dividend</p>
<p> 1996	   $0.23	n/a	 102     n/a</p>
<p> 1997	   $0.84	n/a	  28     n/a</p>
<p> 1998	   $1.59	n/a	  15     n/a</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
